{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36639","headline":"九华山费徵君所居 · 罗隐","name":"九华山费徵君所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草堂何处试徘徊，见说遗踪向此开。\n蟾桂自归三径後，鹤书曾降九天来。\n白云事迹依前在，青琐光阴竟不回。\n尽夕爲君思曩日，野泉呜咽路莓苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}